{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t海關於本月9日及13日偵破兩宗涉嫌利用內河船走私的案件，檢獲大批懷疑走私貨物，估計市值共約3300萬元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n海關透過情報分析及風險評估，抽查兩艘由香港出發前往澳門的內河船。經查驗後，在船上檢獲大批懷疑走私貨物，包括約74萬件懷疑藥劑製品。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n案件仍在調查，不排除會有人被捕。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:32.086105+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:34.258219+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:27.455238+00:00","content_hash":"b61b03c2bc44f8fb9b271068d632296ae965efa2ce99be74660d879113f3b134","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}